  "body": "It's not entirely clear to me from the spec.  https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#initialize-document-csp is aliasing things from parent/opener but not explicitly aliasing things from the response.  And the response creation at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#process-the-iframe-attributes in the srcdoc case doesn't make it clear whether the CSP list is set by value or by reference...",
